QuestGuidance.Register("en",147,{
[4673]="7002483E\n1\tDeliver the jewelled sword sheaths to Tinúriel at Echad Dúnann in Eregion\030Collect jewelled sword sheaths (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to deliver jewelled sword sheaths from the Men and half-orcs found near Echad Dúnann to the Elf-maid Tinúriel. Tinúriel can be found in Echad Dúnann.\n",
[4674]="70024802\n1\tDeliver the knotted branches to the collection box at Thornehad in the Trollshaws\030Collect knotted branches (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect knotted branches from the Wood-trolls in the areas surrounding Thorenhad. The items are to be delivered to the collection box at the outpost.\n",
[4675]="7002454E\n1\tDeliver the large filth to Thaliollang at Lin Giliath\030Collect large filth (total: 10)\tYou are on a task to collect large filth from the insects and spiders plaguing Meluinen and to deliver them to Thaliollang. Thaliollang can be found at Lin Giliath, the Elf-ruins of Meluinen.\n",
[4676]="70024830\n1\tDeliver the monstrous ears to Tinúriel at Echad Dúnann in Eregion\030Collect monstrous ears (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to deliver monstrous ears from the beasts found near Echad Dúnann to the Elf-maid Tinúriel. Tinúriel can be found in Echad Dúnann.\n",
[4677]="70024846\n1\tDeliver the monstrous filth to Maedlathron in Gwingris within Eregion\030Collect monstrous filth (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to deliver monstrous filth from the insects near and surrounding the Elf-encampment of Gwingris to the Elf Maedlathron.\n",
[4678]="7002482A\n1\tDeliver the monstrous goo to Maedlathron in Gwingris within Eregion\030Collect monstrous goo (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to deliver monstrous goo from the insects near and surrounding the Elf-encampment of Gwingris to the Elf Maedlathron.\n",
[4679]="7002484A\n1\tDeliver the monstrous heartwood to Maedlathron in Gwingris within Eregion\030Collect monstrous heartwood (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to deliver monstrous heartwood from the twisted creatures of nature near and surrounding the Elf-encampment of Gwingris to the Elf Maedlathron.\n",
[4680]="70024841\n1\tDeliver the monstrous wings to Maedlathron in Gwingris within Eregion\030Collect monstrous wings (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to deliver monstrous wings from the birds near and surrounding the Elf-encampment of Gwingris to the Elf Maedlathron.\n",
[4681]="70024842\n1\tDeliver the monstrous wings to Tinúriel at Echad Dúnann in Eregion\030Collect monstrous wings (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to deliver monstrous wings from the wicked craban-scouts found near Echad Dúnann to the Elf-maid Tinúriel. Tinúriel can be found in Echad Dúnann.\n",
[4682]="70024810\n1\tDeliver the new sword sheaths to Bainthir at Echad Candelleth in the Trollshaws\030Collect new sword sheaths (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect new sword sheaths from the goblins, Orcs, and other intelligent life surrounding Echad Candelleth. You are to deliver the items to Bainthir at the camp.\n",
[4683]="7002482E\n1\tDeliver the polished wings to Maegamiel at Echad Mirobel in southern Eregion\030Collect polished wings (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to deliver polished wings from the birds surrounding Echad Mirobel to Maegamiel. Maegamiel defends Echad Mirobel in the southern area of Eregion.\n",
[4684]="70024839\n1\tDeliver the powerful branches to Maedlathron in Gwingris within Eregion\030Collect powerful branches (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to deliver powerful branches from the twisted creatures of nature near and surrounding the Elf-encampment of Gwingris to the Elf Maedlathron.\n",
[4685]="700247F5\n1\tDeliver the ridged finger-bones to the collection box at Thorenhad in the Trollshaws\030Collect ridged finger-bones (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect ridged finger-bones from the Dead in the areas surrounding Thorenhad. The items are to be delivered to the collection box at the outpost.\n",
[4686]="70024546\n1\tDeliver the scarred heartwood to Thaliollang at Lin Giliath\030Collect scarred heartwood (total: 10)\tYou are on a task to collect scarred heartwood from the bog-lurkers of Meluinen and to deliver them to Thaliollang. Thaliollang can be found at Lin Giliath, the Elf-ruins of Meluinen.\n",
[4687]="7002454B\n1\tDeliver the sharp claws to Thaliollang at Lin Giliath\030Collect sharp claws (total: 10)\tYou are on a task to collect sharp claws from the massive toads plaguing Meluinen and to deliver them to Thaliollang. Thaliollang can be found at Lin Giliath, the Elf-ruins of Meluinen.\n",
[4688]="700247F4\n1\tDeliver the silky filth to the collection box\030Collect silky filth (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect silky filth from the spiders in the areas surrounding Thorenhad. The items are to be delivered to a collection box. There is a collection box at Thorenhad in the Trollshaws.\n",
[4689]="7002480B\n1\tDeliver the silky filth to Bainthir at Echad Candelleth in the Trollshaws\030Collect silky filth (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect silky filth from the insects surrounding Echad Candelleth. You are to deliver the items to Bainthir at the camp or to a collection box.\n",
[4690]="700247F7\n1\tDeliver the smooth scales to Bainthir at Echad Candelleth in the Trollshaws\030Collect smooth scales (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect smooth scales from the worms surrounding Echad Candelleth. You are to deliver the items to Bainthir at the camp.\n",
[4691]="700247F6\n1\tDeliver the smooth wings to the collection box at Thorenhad in the Trollshaws\030Collect smooth wings (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect smooth wings from the birds in the areas surrounding Thorenhad. The items are to be delivered to the collection box at the outpost.\n",
[4692]="70024548\n1\tDeliver the tough carapaces to Thaliollang at Lin Giliath\030Collect tough carapaces (total: 10)\tYou are on a task to collect tough carapaces from bog-lurkers and insects found in Meluinen and to deliver them to Thaliollang. Thaliollang can be found at Lin Giliath, the Elf-ruins of Meluinen.\n",
[4693]="70024547\n1\tDeliver the tough sword sheaths to Thaliollang at Lin Giliath\030Collect tough sword sheaths (total: 10)\tYou are on a task to collect Tough Sword Sheaths from Orcs plaguing Meluinen and to deliver them to Thaliollang. Thaliollang can be found at Lin Giliath, the Elf-ruins of Meluinen.\n",
[4694]="700247F0\n1\tDeliver the very sharp beaks to the collection box at Thorenhad in the Trollshaws\030Collect very sharp beaks (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect very sharp beaks from the birds in the areas surrounding Thorenhad. The items are to be delivered to the collection box at the outpost.\n",
[4695]="70058FE0\n1\tDestroy Orkish trebuchets on the battlefield around Zudramdân (total: 6)\030Destroy Orkish ballistae on the battlefield around Zudramdân (total: 6)\030Destroy Orkish catapults on the battlefield around Zudramdân (total: 3)\tOrkish ballistae, catapults, and trebuchets can be found on the battlefield around Zudramdân in the War of Three Peaks. Reithvald Red-ember has tasked you with destroying the siege engines used by the Orcs of Gundabad.\n2\tTalk to Reithvald Red-ember\tReithvald Red-ember can be found at Ifbar-athrâkh. You have destroyed many Orkish siege engines. You should report your success to Reithvald Red-ember.\n",
[4696]="70058FCA\n1\tDouse lingering fires at Zarkul-sulûn (total: 10)\tFires can be found throughout Zarkul-sulûn. Darfin has asked you to douse lingering fires throughout Zarkul-sulûn.\n2\tTalk to Darfin\tDarfin can be found at Zarkul-sulûn. You have doused many lingering fires at Zarkul-sulûn. You should report to Darfin.\n",
[4697]="7005784A\n1\tCatch emerald fireflies (total: 12)\tYou can find emerald fireflies in the Midgewater Marshes from gloaming till dawn. You should collect fireflies for the wedding planner in Minas Tirith.\n2\tTalk to Merilien\tThe wedding planner Merilien is located on the Seventh Circle of Minas Tirith. Return to Minas Tirith with the firefly-filled lanterns.\n3\tPlace emerald firefly lanterns ([see journal]/4)\tThe Merry Swan is on the Third Circle of Minas Tirith. You should place emerald firefly lanterns about the stage in the Merry Swan.\n",
[4698]="7000887A\n1\tReturn to Lieutenant Solvi at Tol Ascarnen\030Collect norbog-gizzards (total: 5)\030Collect slabs of norbog meat (total: 5)\tThere are nerbyg all around Tol Ascarnen. Lieutenant Solvi is at Tol Ascarnen. Lieutenant Solvi awaits your return with the meat and gizzards from the nerbyg.\n",
[4699]="70015472\n1\tDefeat the emissary in Ninknakh Faltor\030Defeat the emissary in Gloku-ru\030Defeat the emissary at Durin's Crossing\tThe White Hand Uruks can be found among the goblins and Orcs inhabiting Durin's Way. One was seen at Ninknakh Faltor, north of the Chamber of the Cross-roads. Another was seen at Gloku-ru to the north-east. The last was seen on the road to Jazârgund at Durin's Crossing, to the north and east. Kalman has asked you to go forth and defeat the emissaries of the White Hand.\n2\tTalk to Kalman at the entrance to Zirakzigil\tKalman is at the Door to the Clouds in Durin's Way. You should inform Kalman that the White Hand emissaries in Durin's Way have been defeated.\n",
[4700]="7006F2D4\n1\tMeet up with Shenzâmin and Kishâtal at the cross-road south of Jiret-menêsh\tShenzâmin and Kishâtal agreed to meet you at the cross-roads south of Jiret-menêsh.\n2\tTalk to Shenzâmin at the cross-road south of Jiret-menêsh\tShenzâmin is at the cross-road south of Jiret-menêsh.\n3\tTalk to Dejemûl at the cross-road south of Jiret-menêsh\tDejemûl is at the cross-road south of Jiret-menêsh.\n4\tTalk to Kishâtal at the cross-road south of Jiret-menêsh\tKishâtal at the cross-road south of Jiret-menêsh has listened to the merchant's words and wants to speak to you.\n5\tVisit Khanâg Valoyar before you go to Jiret-menêsh\tShenzâmin suggested that you first visit Khanâg Valoyar before you go to Jiret-menêsh.\n6\tTalk to Habâti at Khanâg Valoyar\tThe Temámir dwarf Habâti at Khanâg Valoyar has accosted you with shouted insults.\n7\tTalk to Shenzâmin at Khanâg Valoyar\tShenzâmin is at Khanâg Valoyar, bristling with anger at your treatment by the Temámir Habâti.\n8\tFind the entrance to Jiret-menêsh far north of Khanâg Valoyar\tThe entrance to Jiret-menêsh is along the road north of Khanâg Valoyar.\n9\tFind Châmelek Gêta, the ruler of Jiret-menêsh, inside the fortress\tChâmelek Gêta, the ruler of Jiret-menêsh, is at her throne within the fortress.\n10\tTalk to Châmelek Gêta, the ruler of Jiret-menêsh\tChâmelek Gêta, the ruler of Jiret-menêsh, is inside the fortress.\n11\tTalk to Shenzâmin in the fortress of Jiret-menêsh\tShenzâmin is in the fortress of Jiret-menêsh, near Châmelek Gêta.\n12\tDefeat gredbyg at the Slopes of Shâlahin (total: 6)\030Collect egg clusters at the Slopes of Shâlahin (total: 4)\030Defeat worms at the Seething-wells (total: 6)\030Collect misplaced axes at the Seething-wells (total: 4)\tChâmelek Gêta, the ruler of Jiret-menêsh, asked you to help her people deal with the creatures at either the gredbyg camp to the west or the worm camp to the east.\n13\tTalk to Châmelek Gêta, the ruler of Jiret-menêsh\tThe ruler of Jiret-menêsh is inside the fortress.\n14\tTalk to Shenzâmin in the fortress of Jiret-menêsh\tShenzâmin is in the fortress of Jiret-menêsh.\n",
[4701]="7004A820\n1\tDefeat the Rogmul Emissary\030Defeat foes in Fushaum Tûm (total: 12)\tIngold has asked you to defeat the Rogmul Emissary visiting Fushaum Tûm and to defeat those who may be persuaded by the Nameless creature.\n",
[4702]="70051605\n1\tMinas Maur is one of the large towers of Barad Gúlaran, south of Gath Forthnír. You must travel to Barad Gúlaran and defeat the emissary from Goblin-town inside Minas Maur. Brúfair suggested you take allies with you.\t\n2\tTalk to Brúnfair\tGath Forthnír is north of Barad Gúluran. Having defeated Prakhum, return to Gath Forthnír and let Brúnfair know what you have done.\n",
[4703]="70051608\n1\tMinas Angos is a tower in Barad Gúlaran, south of Gath Forthnír. You must travel to Barad Gúlaran and defeat Laugi Goldentongue, the emissary of the Dourhands, inside Minas Angos. Brúnfair suggested you take allies.\t\n2\tTalk to Brúnfair\tBrúnfair is at Gath Forthnír, north of Barad Gúlaran. Having defeated Laugi Goldentongue, you should return to Brúnfair and tell him of your victory.\n",
[4704]="7004954F\n1\tTalk to Gimli at the ruins of Díngarth\tGimli can be found at the ruins of Díngarth in Dor Amarth. Spakorth of the Stout-axes has offered to treat with Gimli at Blozronk. You should return to Gimli and Legolas.\n2\tTalk to Gimli at Blozronk\tGimli can be found at his camp-site within Dor Amarth. Spakorth has told the tale of his people's enslavement by a Black Númenórean and how the House that belonged to his ancestors was slowly brought to ruin by Sauron. You should speak to Gimli about what is to be done.\n3\tTalk to Spakorth at Blozronk\tSpakorth can be found at Blozronk in Dor Amarth. Gimli and Legolas have discussed their concerns, but Gimli appears eager to help the Dwarves of Lûghash despite Legolas's reticence. You should now speak to Spakorth and learn how best to aid his folk.\n",
})
